{"slug": "C_S02E11", "video_name": "Community - S02E11 - Abed's Uncontrollable Christmas Bluray-1080p Proper.mkv", "subtitle_name": "Community - S02E11 - Abed's Uncontrollable Christmas Bluray-1080p Proper.en.hi.srt", "duration_seconds": 1286.999, "language": "en", "stt_provider": "local", "stt_model": "ggml-small.en-q5_1.bin", "segment_count": 523, "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 4.436923076923077, "text": "It's that very special time of year, Greendale, a"}, {"start": 4.436923076923077, "end": 8.24, "text": "time for me to remind you that your school"}, {"start": 8.24, "end": 11.92, "text": "acknowledges no specialness to this time of year."}, {"start": 11.92, "end": 14.393777777777778, "text": "You do, of course, have a constitutional right"}, {"start": 14.393777777777778, "end": 16.76, "text": "to lend this season the significance of your"}, {"start": 16.76, "end": 20.4, "text": "choosing in any of our designated holiday zones."}, {"start": 20.4, "end": 23.8, "text": "Merry Christmas, everybody."}, {"start": 23.8, "end": 25.6, "text": "Don't you mean season's greetings?"}, {"start": 25.6, "end": 26.6, "text": "Come on, Shirley."}, {"start": 26.6, "end": 27.6, "text": "You know it's Christmas."}, {"start": 27.6, "end": 31.4, "text": "As a modern Christian, I've learned to be sensitive to other cultures' jealousies."}, {"start": 31.4, "end": 32.4, "text": "So what are we doing this year?"}, {"start": 32.4, "end": 36.16, "text": "Well, I'm taking a relaxation course next semester, and I was going to use the break"}, {"start": 36.16, "end": 37.68, "text": "to do all the reading in advance."}, {"start": 37.68, "end": 40.04, "text": "I'm sending myself in with my video games."}, {"start": 40.04, "end": 41.04, "text": "Fake murdering, people."}, {"start": 41.04, "end": 43.84, "text": "It's going to be my new holiday tradition."}, {"start": 43.84, "end": 44.84, "text": "This is disappointing."}, {"start": 44.84, "end": 46.08, "text": "What do you care about Christmas, Abe?"}, {"start": 46.08, "end": 47.08, "text": "You're Muslim."}, {"start": 47.08, "end": 50.0, "text": "Don't your people spend this season writing angry letters to TV Guide?"}, {"start": 50.0, "end": 51.0, "text": "It's true."}, {"start": 51.0, "end": 52.0, "text": "Religiously, I'm Muslim."}, {"start": 52.0, "end": 53.4, "text": "But I've always been a big fan of Christmas."}, {"start": 53.4, "end": 56.36, "text": "And this is the most important Christmas in the history of the universe."}, {"start": 56.36, "end": 59.0, "text": "I'm assuming that's why we're all stop motion animated."}, {"start": 59.0, "end": 61.96, "text": "I vote we let it go."}, {"start": 61.96, "end": 63.32, "text": "What did you say we were, Abed?"}, {"start": 63.32, "end": 64.32, "text": "We're stop motion animated."}, {"start": 64.32, "end": 65.68, "text": "I don't understand what he's saying."}, {"start": 65.68, "end": 67.56, "text": "I never understand what any of you are saying."}, {"start": 67.56, "end": 68.56, "text": "You guys don't see it?"}, {"start": 68.56, "end": 69.56, "text": "I noticed it this morning."}, {"start": 69.56, "end": 71.56, "text": "That's how I knew it was a special Christmas."}, {"start": 71.56, "end": 73.0, "text": "We've clearly entered a whole new medium."}, {"start": 73.0, "end": 77.0, "text": "Abed, does the word clearly mean the same thing to you as it does to normal people?"}, {"start": 77.0, "end": 79.8, "text": "It's probably Arabic for not clearly."}, {"start": 79.8, "end": 83.14, "text": "You really expect me to tarnish the high five for that?"}, {"start": 83.14, "end": 85.76, "text": "You guys really don't see what I'm seeing?"}, {"start": 85.76, "end": 86.76, "text": "That worries me a little."}, {"start": 86.76, "end": 88.82, "text": "I think it worries all of us."}, {"start": 88.82, "end": 93.64, "text": "Is there something that we can do to help you with your situation, Abed?"}, {"start": 93.64, "end": 95.16, "text": "For starters, you can move around more."}, {"start": 95.16, "end": 97.0, "text": "Not much point in being animated if you don't."}, {"start": 97.0, "end": 101.74, "text": "And I think we should commit to the format, starting with a song."}, {"start": 101.74, "end": 102.74, "text": "You start."}, {"start": 102.74, "end": 103.74, "text": "I'm sure we'll join in."}, {"start": 103.74, "end": 107.55, "text": "Gimme the snow, light up the trees, deck"}, {"start": 107.55, "end": 111.36, "text": "every hall, and while you can see, roast"}, {"start": 111.36, "end": 112.36, "text": "every nut."}, {"start": 112.36, "end": 118.44, "text": "Missle the toe, this needs to be the best Christmas of the original."}, {"start": 118.44, "end": 122.78545454545454, "text": "20,000 years from now, say the"}, {"start": 122.78545454545454, "end": 128.0, "text": "most successful Christmas was today."}, {"start": 128.0, "end": 133.12, "text": "Okay, we got him, we got him, he's down."}, {"start": 133.12, "end": 138.04, "text": "Now, how many fingers am I holding up and, more importantly, are they still made of"}, {"start": 138.04, "end": 139.04, "text": "clay?"}, {"start": 139.04, "end": 140.04, "text": "Three."}, {"start": 140.04, "end": 141.04, "text": "And I told you, we're not clay."}, {"start": 141.04, "end": 143.3, "text": "We've got balls with foam bodies over ball and socket armatures."}, {"start": 143.3, "end": 145.76, "text": "Fascinating and publishable."}, {"start": 145.76, "end": 148.26, "text": "And you say you have no memory of this morning."}, {"start": 148.26, "end": 150.7327906976744, "text": "You don't recall the emotional crisis that caused"}, {"start": 150.7327906976744, "end": 152.6, "text": "you to take shelter in this delusion."}, {"start": 152.6, "end": 153.6, "text": "It's not a delusion."}, {"start": 153.6, "end": 155.16, "text": "Very, very publishable."}, {"start": 155.16, "end": 158.21953488372094, "text": "Abed, I've been a professor of psychology here"}, {"start": 158.21953488372094, "end": 160.88, "text": "at Greendale for many years, and I think"}, {"start": 160.88, "end": 165.44, "text": "I see a solution to this that might also help you with your situation."}, {"start": 165.44, "end": 168.82, "text": "I'd like to do extensive sessions with you, including hypnosis."}, {"start": 168.82, "end": 169.82, "text": "I don't need therapy."}, {"start": 169.82, "end": 170.92, "text": "Nobody said you did."}, {"start": 170.92, "end": 174.82851063829787, "text": "I just think it would benefit you and, incidentally, me"}, {"start": 174.82851063829787, "end": 177.6, "text": "to get to the real meaning of all this."}, {"start": 177.6, "end": 178.6, "text": "You're right."}, {"start": 178.6, "end": 179.6, "text": "That's it."}, {"start": 179.6, "end": 180.6, "text": "I need to find the meaning of Christmas."}, {"start": 180.6, "end": 184.08, "text": "If I can find the meaning of Christmas, everything will go back to normal."}, {"start": 184.08, "end": 185.08, "text": "Asterisk?"}, {"start": 185.08, "end": 189.36, "text": "Abed, the dean says if you don't get help, they might kick you out of school."}, {"start": 189.36, "end": 192.92, "text": "Why would I want to be in a school that hates Christmas?"}, {"start": 192.92, "end": 193.92, "text": "He's got a point."}, {"start": 193.92, "end": 194.92, "text": "Kidding."}, {"start": 194.92, "end": 200.41213483146066, "text": "Sad, quick Christmas song, sad, quick Christmas"}, {"start": 200.41213483146066, "end": 205.32, "text": "snowman, tragic day gone wrong, sad, quick"}, {"start": 205.32, "end": 206.56, "text": "Christmas song."}, {"start": 206.56, "end": 209.88, "text": "I don't suppose you know the meaning of Christmas, lonely snowman."}, {"start": 209.88, "end": 213.08, "text": "Apparently it means getting fondled by singing mental cases."}, {"start": 213.08, "end": 214.08, "text": "My snowman is alive."}, {"start": 214.08, "end": 215.08, "text": "Yeah, snowman."}, {"start": 215.08, "end": 216.08, "text": "I'm Chang."}, {"start": 216.08, "end": 218.36, "text": "What the hell's wrong with you today?"}, {"start": 218.36, "end": 219.36, "text": "I thought I made you."}, {"start": 219.36, "end": 221.96, "text": "Yeah, you made me need a cry in the shower tonight."}, {"start": 221.96, "end": 224.16, "text": "It's a text from Britta."}, {"start": 224.16, "end": 226.72, "text": "She says the meaning of Christmas is in the study room."}, {"start": 226.72, "end": 231.18278481012658, "text": "Hey, now that you started it, how about"}, {"start": 231.18278481012658, "end": 235.76, "text": "10 more seconds and a third button, huh?"}, {"start": 235.76, "end": 238.0, "text": "You lied to lure me into a group therapy session?"}, {"start": 238.0, "end": 239.0, "text": "Surprise!"}, {"start": 239.0, "end": 240.92, "text": "Pierce, you promised not to do that."}, {"start": 240.92, "end": 241.92, "text": "Surprise."}, {"start": 241.92, "end": 242.92, "text": "Not cool."}, {"start": 242.92, "end": 243.92, "text": "Hold on, Abed."}, {"start": 243.92, "end": 245.12, "text": "I'm not just a psych professor."}, {"start": 245.12, "end": 248.34, "text": "I'm also a Christmas wizard."}, {"start": 248.34, "end": 249.34, "text": "You are?"}, {"start": 249.34, "end": 250.34, "text": "I am."}, {"start": 250.34, "end": 253.84, "text": "And I can help you find the meaning of Christmas."}, {"start": 253.84, "end": 254.84, "text": "Hey, guys."}, {"start": 254.84, "end": 255.84, "text": "Oh, yeah."}, {"start": 255.84, "end": 257.56, "text": "Oh, this feels safe."}, {"start": 257.56, "end": 258.84, "text": "Shut up, Winger."}, {"start": 258.84, "end": 261.0, "text": "What do you think, Abed?"}, {"start": 261.0, "end": 262.32, "text": "Christmas wizard."}, {"start": 262.32, "end": 265.08, "text": "I guess I can see that."}, {"start": 265.08, "end": 266.52, "text": "Have a seat then."}, {"start": 266.52, "end": 267.96, "text": "Nothing to be afraid of."}, {"start": 267.96, "end": 269.36, "text": "All your friends are here."}, {"start": 269.36, "end": 271.96, "text": "They just want to help."}, {"start": 271.96, "end": 272.96, "text": "I'm here for the cookies."}, {"start": 272.96, "end": 273.96, "text": "So what do we do?"}, {"start": 273.96, "end": 279.48, "text": "Well, with your permission, I'd like to put you into a state of Christmas-nosis and"}, {"start": 279.48, "end": 282.12, "text": "take you on a magic journey."}, {"start": 282.12, "end": 283.12, "text": "To Winter Wonderland?"}, {"start": 283.12, "end": 284.12, "text": "Sure."}, {"start": 284.12, "end": 286.56, "text": "Your own personal Winter Wonderland."}, {"start": 286.56, "end": 287.64, "text": "Come on, everyone."}, {"start": 287.64, "end": 290.4, "text": "You all know how magic Christmas journeys work."}, {"start": 290.4, "end": 292.92, "text": "You are playing with so much fire."}, {"start": 292.92, "end": 294.12, "text": "Shut up, Winger."}, {"start": 294.12, "end": 295.12, "text": "Hands on the table."}, {"start": 295.12, "end": 296.12, "text": "Eyes closed."}, {"start": 296.12, "end": 297.12, "text": "It's relaxing."}, {"start": 297.12, "end": 298.12, "text": "Next relaxing."}, {"start": 298.12, "end": 299.12, "text": "Don't relax, Pierce."}, {"start": 299.12, "end": 300.12, "text": "Any lower."}, {"start": 300.12, "end": 301.12, "text": "Screw you."}, {"start": 301.12, "end": 307.56, "text": "Abed, focus on the sound of my voice and let yourself relax."}, {"start": 307.56, "end": 309.28, "text": "With each breath, you'll feel--"}, {"start": 309.28, "end": 310.28, "text": "It's beginning."}, {"start": 310.28, "end": 311.28, "text": "All right, then?"}, {"start": 311.28, "end": 312.28, "text": "The table's moving."}, {"start": 312.28, "end": 313.28, "text": "We're about to take off."}, {"start": 313.28, "end": 314.28, "text": "Now it's leaving the floor."}, {"start": 314.28, "end": 315.28, "text": "It's all in the ceiling."}, {"start": 315.28, "end": 316.28, "text": "Fly away."}, {"start": 316.28, "end": 319.28, "text": "We're in outer Christmas space."}, {"start": 319.28, "end": 320.28, "text": "There's Planet Halle."}, {"start": 320.28, "end": 321.28, "text": "And Planet Jollie."}, {"start": 321.28, "end": 324.28, "text": "Oh, and what's that up ahead?"}, {"start": 324.28, "end": 326.28, "text": "Oh, it's Planet Abed."}, {"start": 326.28, "end": 327.28, "text": "Subtle."}, {"start": 327.28, "end": 328.84, "text": "Yeah, we're actually descending on a Planet Abed now."}, {"start": 328.84, "end": 331.2, "text": "It's the most Christmasy planet in the universe."}, {"start": 331.2, "end": 335.28, "text": "Its atmosphere is 7% cinnamon."}, {"start": 335.28, "end": 339.36, "text": "We're here."}, {"start": 339.36, "end": 340.36, "text": "Winter Wonderland."}, {"start": 340.36, "end": 341.36, "text": "See how sparkly?"}, {"start": 341.36, "end": 342.36, "text": "You crazy?"}, {"start": 342.36, "end": 343.36, "text": "Oh, I see."}, {"start": 343.36, "end": 345.12, "text": "It's a-- ooh, sparkly, Winter Wonderland."}, {"start": 345.12, "end": 347.6, "text": "You might notice that during our journey, you've transformed into Christmas versions"}, {"start": 347.6, "end": 348.6, "text": "of yourselves."}, {"start": 348.6, "end": 352.32, "text": "Jeff in the box."}, {"start": 352.32, "end": 353.32, "text": "Ah ha."}, {"start": 353.32, "end": 354.32, "text": "Troy Soldier."}, {"start": 354.32, "end": 355.32, "text": "Cool."}, {"start": 355.32, "end": 356.32, "text": "Do I have a gun?"}, {"start": 356.32, "end": 357.32, "text": "You have a drum."}, {"start": 357.32, "end": 358.32, "text": "Cool."}, {"start": 358.32, "end": 359.32, "text": "Britta?"}, {"start": 359.32, "end": 360.32, "text": "You're Britta Bot."}, {"start": 360.32, "end": 361.32, "text": "Just go with it."}, {"start": 361.32, "end": 362.32, "text": "Bleep."}, {"start": 362.32, "end": 363.32, "text": "Bloop."}, {"start": 363.32, "end": 364.32, "text": "Teddy Pierce."}, {"start": 364.32, "end": 365.32, "text": "Bleep."}, {"start": 365.32, "end": 366.32, "text": "Bloop."}, {"start": 366.32, "end": 367.32, "text": "For me too."}, {"start": 367.32, "end": 368.32, "text": "Valoranny."}, {"start": 368.32, "end": 369.32, "text": "Baby Doll Shirley."}, {"start": 369.32, "end": 370.32, "text": "Baby Word?"}, {"start": 370.32, "end": 371.32, "text": "What the hell?"}, {"start": 371.32, "end": 376.88, "text": "Well, we are making fabulous and unexpectedly intense progress."}, {"start": 376.88, "end": 382.0, "text": "Now, what I'd like to do is visit the Cave of Frozen Memories."}, {"start": 382.0, "end": 383.0, "text": "Pass."}, {"start": 383.0, "end": 384.0, "text": "Let's head for the North Pole."}, {"start": 384.0, "end": 385.72, "text": "The meaning of Christmas will be there."}, {"start": 385.72, "end": 386.96, "text": "Um, well, yeah."}, {"start": 386.96, "end": 387.96, "text": "Yeah, sure."}, {"start": 387.96, "end": 388.96, "text": "Cheers."}, {"start": 388.96, "end": 393.52, "text": "And I actually think I know a shortcut to the North Pole through the Cave of Frozen"}, {"start": 393.52, "end": 394.52, "text": "Memories."}, {"start": 394.52, "end": 395.52, "text": "Fine."}, {"start": 395.52, "end": 396.84, "text": "I guess we can take Gum Drop Road through Carroll Canyon and stop at the cave."}, {"start": 396.84, "end": 400.72, "text": "I wouldn't call it a shortcut, but you got us here, so I'll throw you a bone."}, {"start": 400.72, "end": 405.48, "text": "Come with me and walk with me and see what we can find."}, {"start": 405.48, "end": 409.47940298507467, "text": "Accompany me on a journey with me"}, {"start": 409.47940298507467, "end": 413.6, "text": "through the wonderland in my mind."}, {"start": 413.6, "end": 414.72, "text": "Let's move, folks."}, {"start": 414.72, "end": 421.664, "text": "This isn't going"}, {"start": 421.664, "end": 426.00399999999996, "text": "to be fun,"}, {"start": 426.00399999999996, "end": 432.08, "text": "easy, or safe."}, {"start": 432.08, "end": 433.08, "text": "Fair warning, guys."}, {"start": 433.08, "end": 435.96, "text": "A journey through winter wonderland tends to test your commitment to Christmas, so"}, {"start": 435.96, "end": 437.8, "text": "when I say test, I mean Wonka style."}, {"start": 437.8, "end": 438.8, "text": "I'm talking dark."}, {"start": 438.8, "end": 439.8, "text": "My advice."}, {"start": 439.8, "end": 444.0, "text": "Stay honest, stay alert, and for the love of God, stay between the Gum Drops."}, {"start": 444.72, "end": 446.6, "text": "Look up there, Abed."}, {"start": 446.6, "end": 450.48, "text": "I think I see the Cave of Frozen Memories."}, {"start": 450.48, "end": 451.48, "text": "A great place."}, {"start": 451.48, "end": 453.08, "text": "It's actually the Cave of Frozen Peas."}, {"start": 453.08, "end": 454.24, "text": "It's a common mistake."}, {"start": 454.24, "end": 455.24, "text": "Don't worry, Christmas Wizard."}, {"start": 455.24, "end": 456.24, "text": "I got this."}, {"start": 456.24, "end": 457.24, "text": "Terrific."}, {"start": 457.24, "end": 458.24, "text": "Abed."}, {"start": 458.24, "end": 462.4, "text": "Did you say my Christmas elf was a baby?"}, {"start": 462.4, "end": 465.12, "text": "Are you sure you didn't say I was a Christmas angel?"}, {"start": 465.12, "end": 466.56, "text": "I think that must be what you said, right?"}, {"start": 466.56, "end": 468.4, "text": "Because you respect me too much to imagine me as a baby."}, {"start": 468.4, "end": 470.4, "text": "Jeez, maybe if you cry enough, we'll change you."}, {"start": 470.4, "end": 472.6, "text": "Uh, you do know why he said you were a robot, right?"}, {"start": 472.6, "end": 474.4, "text": "Because I'm progressive and kick-ass."}, {"start": 474.4, "end": 475.88, "text": "How about Heartless and Godless?"}, {"start": 475.88, "end": 478.24, "text": "I think he just gave us random identities, you guys."}, {"start": 478.24, "end": 483.88, "text": "I mean, me, a ballerina, it's not like I'm that thin and graceful, right?"}, {"start": 483.88, "end": 487.76, "text": "Annie, it's because you're fragile and tightly wound."}, {"start": 487.76, "end": 492.24, "text": "Ladies, cut the non-thematic chatter and keep your eyes on the prize."}, {"start": 492.24, "end": 493.88, "text": "We're looking for the meaning of Christmas."}, {"start": 493.88, "end": 495.04, "text": "Uh, you know what Abed?"}, {"start": 495.04, "end": 497.92, "text": "I happen to know the meaning of Christmas, and I'm pretty sure I'm the only one here"}, {"start": 497.92, "end": 498.92, "text": "that does."}, {"start": 498.92, "end": 500.6404444444444, "text": "So I would appreciate a certain level of respect,"}, {"start": 500.6404444444444, "end": 502.08, "text": "even if I am a guest in your make-believe"}, {"start": 502.08, "end": 503.08, "text": "therapy wonderland."}, {"start": 503.08, "end": 504.08, "text": "Therapy?"}, {"start": 504.08, "end": 505.08, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 505.08, "end": 511.94, "text": "I am freezing Shirley with my wand, and I am injecting her from planet Arbed with a"}, {"start": 511.94, "end": 515.56, "text": "remote control Christmas pterodactyl."}, {"start": 515.56, "end": 518.48, "text": "Oh, nice."}, {"start": 518.48, "end": 521.52, "text": "Now we're talking."}, {"start": 521.52, "end": 525.12, "text": "The point being, if you're not interested in helping Arbed, there's no reason to be"}, {"start": 525.12, "end": 526.16, "text": "here."}, {"start": 526.16, "end": 527.16, "text": "Cookies."}, {"start": 527.16, "end": 531.8358620689655, "text": "Swaddled in her diaper, high upon her throne,"}, {"start": 531.8358620689655, "end": 536.2, "text": "the queen of Christmas babies thought that"}, {"start": 536.2, "end": 540.96, "text": "Christmas was her own."}, {"start": 540.96, "end": 542.96, "text": "That's wonderful."}, {"start": 542.96, "end": 544.96, "text": "Let's get back to the magic journey and wrap up."}, {"start": 544.96, "end": 546.24, "text": "Some of us have women to sleep with."}, {"start": 546.24, "end": 547.84, "text": "You guys hear that?"}, {"start": 547.84, "end": 548.84, "text": "Humbugs."}, {"start": 548.84, "end": 549.84, "text": "Humbugs?"}, {"start": 549.84, "end": 551.84, "text": "Yeah, a whole swarm of them."}, {"start": 551.84, "end": 552.84, "text": "See?"}, {"start": 552.84, "end": 557.64, "text": "Everyone stay perfectly sincere, humbugs are attracted to sarcasm."}, {"start": 557.64, "end": 560.32, "text": "Wow, somewhere out there Tim Burton just got a boner."}, {"start": 560.32, "end": 561.72, "text": "Jeff, don't be sarcastic."}, {"start": 561.72, "end": 563.12, "text": "Oh, are they on me now?"}, {"start": 563.12, "end": 564.12, "text": "Oh no."}, {"start": 564.12, "end": 565.12, "text": "You think they're alive?"}, {"start": 565.12, "end": 568.64, "text": "If only he could find the power to not be a smug douche."}, {"start": 568.64, "end": 569.64, "text": "Oh no, can't do."}, {"start": 569.64, "end": 570.64, "text": "I'm just a horrible guy."}, {"start": 570.64, "end": 573.64, "text": "Guess I'll have to go get laid."}, {"start": 573.64, "end": 574.64, "text": "Ooh!"}, {"start": 574.64, "end": 577.64, "text": "Can I sing this one?"}, {"start": 577.64, "end": 582.3955555555556, "text": "Mmm, bitter, shallow, hipster,"}, {"start": 582.3955555555556, "end": 586.2, "text": "sweater, matching socks."}, {"start": 586.2, "end": 591.48, "text": "Christmas needs more presents than a haircut in a box."}, {"start": 591.48, "end": 592.48, "text": "Annie, nice."}, {"start": 592.48, "end": 595.2, "text": "Get what I did with the word presents?"}, {"start": 595.2, "end": 597.2, "text": "This is Carol Canyon."}, {"start": 597.2, "end": 600.52, "text": "Instead of oxygen, the plants produce Christmas songs."}, {"start": 600.52, "end": 601.92, "text": "Will it cost a lot to walk through here?"}, {"start": 601.92, "end": 603.0, "text": "No, no, it's public domain."}, {"start": 603.0, "end": 606.0, "text": "You guys know Jesus was born in the middle of April, right?"}, {"start": 606.0, "end": 609.32, "text": "The church moved its birthday to December so they could steal the solstice from the"}, {"start": 609.32, "end": 610.32, "text": "pagans."}, {"start": 610.32, "end": 612.32, "text": "Season's greetings from Britta Perry."}, {"start": 612.32, "end": 614.64, "text": "Maybe you could sing a song about it, Britta."}, {"start": 614.64, "end": 618.0, "text": "I don't sing, and if I did, I wouldn't sing Christmas songs."}, {"start": 618.0, "end": 619.8289655172414, "text": "I guess that means you're going to have"}, {"start": 619.8289655172414, "end": 622.08, "text": "me ejected from Winter Wonderland for not loving"}, {"start": 622.08, "end": 623.08, "text": "Christmas enough."}, {"start": 623.08, "end": 624.08, "text": "Nope, not for that."}, {"start": 624.08, "end": 626.08, "text": "Let's get to the Cave of Frozen Memories."}, {"start": 626.08, "end": 629.08, "text": "Man, it is cave-like in here."}, {"start": 629.08, "end": 630.08, "text": "What do you mean cave-like?"}, {"start": 630.08, "end": 631.08, "text": "It's a cave."}, {"start": 631.08, "end": 633.04, "text": "What would you be afraid of?"}, {"start": 633.04, "end": 635.7566666666667, "text": "A cave of frozen memories is a safe"}, {"start": 635.7566666666667, "end": 639.56, "text": "place where we can observe suppressed experiences"}, {"start": 639.56, "end": 641.84, "text": "without being affected by them."}, {"start": 641.84, "end": 642.92, "text": "Can you show me how to do it?"}, {"start": 643.518, "end": 643.8772592592593, "text": "Sure."}, {"start": 643.8772592592593, "end": 649.3380000000001, "text": "Here, I'm focusing on a part of the cave, and I'm seeing my tenth Christmas."}, {"start": 649.3380000000001, "end": 650.006717948718, "text": "Alright?"}, {"start": 650.006717948718, "end": 652.5980000000001, "text": "Now you try, with this morning."}, {"start": 652.5980000000001, "end": 653.989076923077, "text": "I can't see your tenth Christmas."}, {"start": 653.989076923077, "end": 655.3380000000001, "text": "How do you even know that's you?"}, {"start": 655.3380000000001, "end": 659.178, "text": "Well, it's my house on 52nd Street in Islington."}, {"start": 659.178, "end": 660.1431063829788, "text": "What room are you in?"}, {"start": 660.1431063829788, "end": 661.3380000000001, "text": "What colour are the walls?"}, {"start": 661.3380000000001, "end": 662.6097948717949, "text": "Our living room."}, {"start": 662.6097948717949, "end": 664.438, "text": "Cream-coloured plaster."}, {"start": 664.438, "end": 667.678, "text": "There's an oil painting of a forest above the sofa."}, {"start": 667.678, "end": 669.7641290322581, "text": "I'm reading Paddington books."}, {"start": 669.7641290322581, "end": 672.138, "text": "Mom got me Paddington every year."}, {"start": 672.138, "end": 673.124, "text": "Where's your dad?"}, {"start": 673.124, "end": 674.6320000000001, "text": "It's Christmas, Professor."}, {"start": 674.6320000000001, "end": 675.618, "text": "Where's your dad?"}, {"start": 675.618, "end": 676.7004489795919, "text": "I don't know!"}, {"start": 676.7004489795919, "end": 677.8661632653061, "text": "We never know!"}, {"start": 677.8661632653061, "end": 679.698, "text": "Mom won't stop crying!"}, {"start": 679.698, "end": 682.3580000000001, "text": "I'm going to America with Grandpa!"}, {"start": 688.198, "end": 689.898, "text": "He is good."}, {"start": 689.898, "end": 691.138, "text": "We lost our wizard."}, {"start": 691.138, "end": 692.0020000000001, "text": "We don't need him."}, {"start": 692.0020000000001, "end": 692.4820000000001, "text": "Never did."}, {"start": 692.4820000000001, "end": 693.778, "text": "And nobody needs this cave."}, {"start": 695.538, "end": 696.878, "text": "Initiate self-destruct."}, {"start": 696.878, "end": 699.3380000000001, "text": "Self-destruct initiated."}, {"start": 700.538, "end": 703.038, "text": "This slide goes directly to Pine Tree Station."}, {"start": 703.038, "end": 705.538, "text": "We can catch a train to the North Pole from there."}, {"start": 705.538, "end": 707.638, "text": "The wizard didn't bring us here to find the meaning of Christmas,"}, {"start": 707.638, "end": 710.618, "text": "and I can't have anyone going beyond this point that's on his side."}, {"start": 712.018, "end": 714.336918918919, "text": "We'll get you to the end, man."}, {"start": 714.336918918919, "end": 714.878, "text": "Always."}, {"start": 720.8580000000001, "end": 722.658, "text": "Like I said, I came for the cookies."}, {"start": 724.0980000000001, "end": 726.558, "text": "I'm not ejecting you for your not-liking Christmas music, Britta."}, {"start": 726.558, "end": 728.898, "text": "I'm ejecting you for lying to trick me into therapy."}, {"start": 728.898, "end": 731.998, "text": "Abin, they will kick you out of school!"}, {"start": 731.998, "end": 733.898, "text": "I was trying to save you!"}, {"start": 734.738, "end": 739.238, "text": "Britta, but programmed badly."}, {"start": 739.238, "end": 743.778, "text": "Wires with fraying ends."}, {"start": 743.778, "end": 748.4580000000001, "text": "Functioning, mad and sadly."}, {"start": 748.4580000000001, "end": 755.4580000000001, "text": "No faith in herself or friends."}, {"start": 757.4580000000001, "end": 758.4580000000001, "text": "Bye, Britta."}, {"start": 758.898, "end": 763.898, "text": "I know, right?"}, {"start": 763.898, "end": 765.898, "text": "Speaking of real, this has been great."}, {"start": 765.898, "end": 767.898, "text": "But the cookies are gone, and I have to take a giant leak."}, {"start": 768.898, "end": 772.898, "text": "We should be at the North Pole by 9 o'clock Eastern Candy Time."}, {"start": 772.898, "end": 774.898, "text": "You guys see the countryside?"}, {"start": 774.898, "end": 775.898, "text": "There's the Menorah Mountains."}, {"start": 775.898, "end": 777.898, "text": "And Jehovah Witness back there."}, {"start": 777.898, "end": 780.898, "text": "We should be at the North Pole by 9 o'clock Eastern Candy Time."}, {"start": 780.898, "end": 782.898, "text": "You guys see the countryside?"}, {"start": 782.898, "end": 783.898, "text": "There's the Menorah Mountains."}, {"start": 783.898, "end": 785.898, "text": "And Jehovah Witness back there."}, {"start": 785.898, "end": 790.898, "text": "Thanks for adding that, man."}, {"start": 790.898, "end": 793.898, "text": "This is nicer than all the Christmases I ever celebrated."}, {"start": 793.898, "end": 794.898, "text": "But you're Jewish."}, {"start": 794.898, "end": 795.898, "text": "On my mom's side."}, {"start": 795.898, "end": 797.898, "text": "But my dad's Episcopalian."}, {"start": 797.898, "end": 801.898, "text": "And before the divorce, the holidays were a minefield of overlapping rituals."}, {"start": 801.898, "end": 803.898, "text": "I like the rituals."}, {"start": 803.898, "end": 805.898, "text": "My parents are divorced, too."}, {"start": 805.898, "end": 806.898, "text": "My mom's Polish."}, {"start": 806.898, "end": 808.898, "text": "She loves Christmas."}, {"start": 808.898, "end": 810.898, "text": "Every year, she visits on the same day, December 9th."}, {"start": 810.898, "end": 814.898, "text": "And every year, we sit and watch Rudolph the Red-Nosed Reindeer, together."}, {"start": 814.898, "end": 817.898, "text": "Every year."}, {"start": 817.898, "end": 820.898, "text": "But Abed, today is December 9th."}, {"start": 820.898, "end": 823.898, "text": "It's the last day of classes."}, {"start": 823.898, "end": 825.898, "text": "Yeah, that can't be right."}, {"start": 825.898, "end": 827.898, "text": "She comes every year."}, {"start": 827.898, "end": 829.898, "text": "Today must be December 8th."}, {"start": 829.898, "end": 831.898, "text": "She comes every year."}, {"start": 834.898, "end": 837.898, "text": "Okay, Abed, time to stop the train."}, {"start": 837.898, "end": 841.898, "text": "After you emasculated me in the ice caves, I went to your dorm room."}, {"start": 841.898, "end": 843.898, "text": "I know what happened now."}, {"start": 843.898, "end": 844.898, "text": "Doesn't matter."}, {"start": 844.898, "end": 845.898, "text": "I just need to get to the North Pole."}, {"start": 845.898, "end": 847.898, "text": "Abed, there is no North Pole."}, {"start": 847.898, "end": 850.898, "text": "We're in the library study room, and I'm not a Christmas wizard."}, {"start": 850.898, "end": 851.898, "text": "I know."}, {"start": 851.898, "end": 853.898, "text": "You're a Christmas warlock."}, {"start": 853.898, "end": 856.898, "text": "You're trying to destroy Christmas because you blame your sadness on it."}, {"start": 856.898, "end": 857.898, "text": "I'm crawling out the window."}, {"start": 857.898, "end": 858.898, "text": "No, you're not."}, {"start": 858.898, "end": 859.898, "text": "Snap out of it."}, {"start": 859.898, "end": 862.898, "text": "Whoa, whoa, who taught you therapy, Michael Jackson's day?"}, {"start": 862.898, "end": 866.898, "text": "I am a professional, and you are tampering with a highly delicate book deal."}, {"start": 866.898, "end": 868.898, "text": "I'm a human being."}, {"start": 868.898, "end": 869.898, "text": "Now we're losing it."}, {"start": 869.898, "end": 870.898, "text": "I'm on the roof of the train."}, {"start": 870.898, "end": 873.898, "text": "Oh, great, well, I'm teleporting there."}, {"start": 873.898, "end": 876.898, "text": "Because I can do that because I'm a wizard."}, {"start": 879.898, "end": 881.898, "text": "Abed, there is no train."}, {"start": 881.898, "end": 883.898, "text": "This is not real."}, {"start": 883.898, "end": 884.898, "text": "I can't hear you."}, {"start": 884.898, "end": 886.898, "text": "I'm going to the front car."}, {"start": 886.898, "end": 889.898, "text": "You're very clever when it stops here."}, {"start": 889.898, "end": 890.898, "text": "There's no more journey."}, {"start": 890.898, "end": 895.898, "text": "It's just you against reality, and reality always wins."}, {"start": 895.898, "end": 898.898, "text": "Abed, I'm uniting the car, okay?"}, {"start": 898.898, "end": 899.498, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 899.498, "end": 901.898, "text": "Oh, give me a break."}, {"start": 901.898, "end": 903.898, "text": "Do you know what you're doing?"}, {"start": 903.898, "end": 905.991023255814, "text": "We're learning to teleport, and we're helping"}, {"start": 905.991023255814, "end": 907.898, "text": "our friend find the meeting of Christmas."}, {"start": 907.898, "end": 910.898, "text": "Hey, you're actually grabbing me in real life, delinquents."}, {"start": 910.898, "end": 912.898, "text": "We'll keep him away, Abed."}, {"start": 912.898, "end": 914.898, "text": "Go, find the meeting of Christmas."}, {"start": 914.898, "end": 917.898, "text": "At the very least, take note."}, {"start": 929.898, "end": 930.2313333333334, "text": "Whew!"}, {"start": 930.2313333333334, "end": 931.8313333333334, "text": "All right, where are we?"}, {"start": 931.8313333333334, "end": 932.898, "text": "Christmas train?"}, {"start": 932.898, "end": 934.898, "text": "I didn't want to go home."}, {"start": 934.898, "end": 936.898, "text": "It's depressing there this time of year."}, {"start": 959.898, "end": 961.898, "text": "What are we looking at?"}, {"start": 961.898, "end": 963.898, "text": "Santa's workshop."}, {"start": 969.898, "end": 973.0000408163265, "text": "Okay, so, meeting of Christmas, right?"}, {"start": 973.0000408163265, "end": 973.898, "text": "You see it?"}, {"start": 973.898, "end": 976.7551428571429, "text": "Well, can it just be anywhere?"}, {"start": 976.7551428571429, "end": 977.898, "text": "Like, there?"}, {"start": 979.898, "end": 981.898, "text": "Good job, Pierce."}, {"start": 988.898, "end": 994.898, "text": "It's the first season of Lost on DVD."}, {"start": 994.898, "end": 996.898, "text": "That's the meeting of Christmas?"}, {"start": 996.898, "end": 998.0744705882353, "text": "No, it's a metaphor."}, {"start": 998.0744705882353, "end": 999.898, "text": "It represents a lack of payoff."}, {"start": 999.898, "end": 1000.3685882352942, "text": "Correct."}, {"start": 1000.3685882352942, "end": 1003.898, "text": "Thinking there was something you could do to save Christmas,"}, {"start": 1003.898, "end": 1007.898, "text": "turning yourself into an animated character in search of the holiday's meaning,"}, {"start": 1007.898, "end": 1012.898, "text": "these were mechanisms you used to escape this."}, {"start": 1012.898, "end": 1018.898, "text": "This Christmas card left where you dropped it on the floor of your dorm."}, {"start": 1018.898, "end": 1021.7551428571429, "text": "Abed, I can't make it this year."}, {"start": 1021.7551428571429, "end": 1023.898, "text": "I have a new family now."}, {"start": 1023.898, "end": 1026.2789523809524, "text": "You'll meet them one day."}, {"start": 1026.2789523809524, "end": 1027.8980000000001, "text": "You're a man now."}, {"start": 1027.8980000000001, "end": 1029.9586060606061, "text": "Take care of Dad."}, {"start": 1029.9586060606061, "end": 1031.8980000000001, "text": "Wash your duper."}, {"start": 1031.8980000000001, "end": 1033.8980000000001, "text": "Mommy's moved on."}, {"start": 1033.8980000000001, "end": 1036.8980000000001, "text": "New family, new life."}, {"start": 1036.8980000000001, "end": 1042.8980000000001, "text": "There's nothing left to do now but heal and share the experience"}, {"start": 1042.8980000000001, "end": 1046.8980000000001, "text": "with as many reputable journals as possible."}, {"start": 1046.8980000000001, "end": 1047.4122857142859, "text": "Great."}, {"start": 1047.4122857142859, "end": 1049.8980000000001, "text": "Look what you did to the kid."}, {"start": 1049.8980000000001, "end": 1051.2664210526318, "text": "What's your article going to be called?"}, {"start": 1051.2664210526318, "end": 1051.8980000000001, "text": "Worst shriek ever?"}, {"start": 1051.8980000000001, "end": 1053.5230000000001, "text": "Hey, this is not my fault."}, {"start": 1053.5230000000001, "end": 1055.8980000000001, "text": "This is what Christmas does to people."}, {"start": 1055.8980000000001, "end": 1058.8980000000001, "text": "We put too much meaning into it and it lets us down."}, {"start": 1058.8980000000001, "end": 1060.8980000000001, "text": "We beg to differ."}, {"start": 1060.8980000000001, "end": 1062.8980000000001, "text": "What are you doing back here?"}, {"start": 1062.8980000000001, "end": 1063.8980000000001, "text": "Saving Christmas."}, {"start": 1063.8980000000001, "end": 1067.8980000000001, "text": "Everybody, point your magic Christmas weapons at me."}, {"start": 1067.8980000000001, "end": 1070.5646666666669, "text": "Oh, brother, this is ridiculous."}, {"start": 1070.5646666666669, "end": 1072.8980000000001, "text": "You are enabling a delusion."}, {"start": 1072.8980000000001, "end": 1076.8980000000001, "text": "The delusion you're trying to cure is called Christmas, Duncan."}, {"start": 1076.8980000000001, "end": 1079.8980000000001, "text": "It's the crazy notion that the longest, coldest, darkest nights"}, {"start": 1079.8980000000001, "end": 1081.8980000000001, "text": "can be the warmest and brightest."}, {"start": 1081.8980000000001, "end": 1085.8980000000001, "text": "Yeah, and when we all agree to support each other in that insanity,"}, {"start": 1085.8980000000001, "end": 1088.5362978723406, "text": "something even crazier happens."}, {"start": 1088.5362978723406, "end": 1089.8980000000001, "text": "It becomes true."}, {"start": 1089.8980000000001, "end": 1092.8980000000001, "text": "Works every year like clockwork."}, {"start": 1092.8980000000001, "end": 1094.8980000000001, "text": "Try telling that to your catatonic friend."}, {"start": 1094.8980000000001, "end": 1096.3614146341465, "text": "I got a better idea."}, {"start": 1096.3614146341465, "end": 1097.8980000000001, "text": "Why don't we sing it?"}, {"start": 1097.8980000000001, "end": 1098.8980000000001, "text": "Wait, what?"}, {"start": 1098.8980000000001, "end": 1099.8980000000001, "text": "Yeah, let's not go overboard."}, {"start": 1099.8980000000001, "end": 1101.8980000000001, "text": "Will you two commit to something for a change?"}, {"start": 1101.8980000000001, "end": 1102.8980000000001, "text": "Let's sing it."}, {"start": 1102.8980000000001, "end": 1103.8980000000001, "text": "Yeah, let's sing."}, {"start": 1103.8980000000001, "end": 1105.8980000000001, "text": "Can we sing while we blow Duncan away?"}, {"start": 1105.8980000000001, "end": 1106.8980000000001, "text": "Absolutely."}, {"start": 1106.8980000000001, "end": 1108.8980000000001, "text": "Ow!"}, {"start": 1108.8980000000001, "end": 1110.8980000000001, "text": "You start griddle."}, {"start": 1110.8980000000001, "end": 1114.8980000000001, "text": "Mmm, Christmas time is a time to sing."}, {"start": 1114.8980000000001, "end": 1117.8980000000001, "text": "That's what Christmas is for."}, {"start": 1117.8980000000001, "end": 1120.8980000000001, "text": "Christmas can even be a Hanukkah thing."}, {"start": 1120.8980000000001, "end": 1122.8980000000001, "text": "That's what Christmas is for."}, {"start": 1122.8980000000001, "end": 1126.8980000000001, "text": "And for a huge percentage of this God-fearing planet"}, {"start": 1126.8980000000001, "end": 1130.8980000000001, "text": "is about the birth of Jesus Christ."}, {"start": 1130.8980000000001, "end": 1133.8980000000001, "text": "For the rest of us, it's still a great time"}, {"start": 1133.8980000000001, "end": 1136.8980000000001, "text": "to remember that it's good to be nice."}, {"start": 1136.8980000000001, "end": 1139.8980000000001, "text": "Music and cookies and liquor and trees."}, {"start": 1139.8980000000001, "end": 1142.8980000000001, "text": "That's what Christmas is for."}, {"start": 1142.8980000000001, "end": 1145.8980000000001, "text": "Video games for two straight weeks."}, {"start": 1145.8980000000001, "end": 1148.8980000000001, "text": "That's what Christmas is for."}, {"start": 1148.8980000000001, "end": 1151.8980000000001, "text": "Hangin' out with the people you love."}, {"start": 1151.8980000000001, "end": 1152.8980000000001, "text": "How?"}, {"start": 1152.8980000000001, "end": 1156.8980000000001, "text": "Sayin' I love you."}, {"start": 1156.8980000000001, "end": 1159.8980000000001, "text": "That's what Christmas is."}, {"start": 1159.8980000000001, "end": 1162.8980000000001, "text": "That's what Christmas is."}, {"start": 1162.8980000000001, "end": 1168.8980000000001, "text": "That's what Christmas is for."}, {"start": 1168.8980000000001, "end": 1173.8980000000001, "text": "And Christmas' pterodactyl."}, {"start": 1173.8980000000001, "end": 1175.8980000000001, "text": "All right, all right, I'm leaving."}, {"start": 1175.8980000000001, "end": 1178.8980000000001, "text": "Initiate self-destruct."}, {"start": 1178.8980000000001, "end": 1180.8980000000001, "text": "Don't you think that's a little--"}, {"start": 1191.8980000000001, "end": 1192.8980000000001, "text": "I get it."}, {"start": 1192.8980000000001, "end": 1196.8980000000001, "text": "The meaning of Christmas is the idea that Christmas has meaning,"}, {"start": 1196.8980000000001, "end": 1198.8980000000001, "text": "and it can mean whatever we want."}, {"start": 1198.8980000000001, "end": 1201.8980000000001, "text": "For me, it used to mean being with my mom."}, {"start": 1201.8980000000001, "end": 1204.8980000000001, "text": "And that means being with you guys."}, {"start": 1205.8980000000001, "end": 1207.8980000000001, "text": "Thanks, Lost."}, {"start": 1212.8980000000001, "end": 1215.8980000000001, "text": "Wow, I feel so much better now."}, {"start": 1215.8980000000001, "end": 1217.8980000000001, "text": "I guess we don't need to be stop motion anymore."}, {"start": 1217.8980000000001, "end": 1221.8980000000001, "text": "Well, why not just keep it going for the rest of Christmas?"}, {"start": 1221.8980000000001, "end": 1224.8980000000001, "text": "It just feels so right."}, {"start": 1229.8980000000001, "end": 1231.8980000000001, "text": "You ever get the urge to just..."}, {"start": 1231.8980000000001, "end": 1233.8980000000001, "text": "Merry Christmas!"}, {"start": 1233.8980000000001, "end": 1236.8980000000001, "text": "Oh, there, you said it."}, {"start": 1250.8980000000001, "end": 1252.8980000000001, "text": "Uh-oh, we're stop motion again."}, {"start": 1252.8980000000001, "end": 1253.8980000000001, "text": "Oh, don't worry, man, I did this."}, {"start": 1253.8980000000001, "end": 1254.8980000000001, "text": "You did?"}, {"start": 1254.8980000000001, "end": 1255.8980000000001, "text": "Yeah, it's cool."}, {"start": 1255.8980000000001, "end": 1256.8980000000001, "text": "Huh, why?"}, {"start": 1256.8980000000001, "end": 1259.8980000000001, "text": "Well, I always liked the way fake food looked on those animated shows."}, {"start": 1259.8980000000001, "end": 1261.8980000000001, "text": "I mean, get a load of these things."}, {"start": 1261.8980000000001, "end": 1264.8980000000001, "text": "They're really stepped up a notch in terms of visual deliciousness."}, {"start": 1264.8980000000001, "end": 1265.8980000000001, "text": "I know what you mean."}, {"start": 1265.8980000000001, "end": 1266.8980000000001, "text": "Look at that perfect bite."}, {"start": 1266.8980000000001, "end": 1268.8980000000001, "text": "It's a little odd that I see this, too, though, don't you think?"}, {"start": 1268.8980000000001, "end": 1269.8980000000001, "text": "Yeah."}, {"start": 1269.8980000000001, "end": 1270.8980000000001, "text": "Ooh, weird that way."}, {"start": 1270.8980000000001, "end": 1271.8980000000001, "text": "I'll say."}, {"start": 1274.8980000000001, "end": 1275.8980000000001, "text": "That's better."}, {"start": 1275.8980000000001, "end": 1276.8980000000001, "text": "So weird."}, {"start": 1276.8980000000001, "end": 1278.8980000000001, "text": "Troy and Abed in stop motion."}]}